#
# Module
#
ModuleVereineName=Vereine (associations AT/DE)
ModuleVereineDesc=Associations under Austrian and German law: country profile, register data and an API for the association's website
ModuleVereineDescLong=Vereine extends Dolibarr's Members module with what associations in Austria and Germany need: country profile, register data and a REST API for the association's website. Tax profiles, membership fee runs, donation reporting, volunteer allowances, officers and the annual accounts follow in the next versions.
Permission49210001=Read the association overview and its data (also through the API)
